---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import Kicker from '../Kicker.astro';
import Card from '../Card.astro';
import { DOCS_URL } from '../../data/site';
---

<Section id="upgrade" tone="light">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]">
    <div>
      <Kicker>Continuity</Kicker>
      <h2 class="mt-[14px] font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px)] font-bold leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.02em]">
        Coming from v5?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-[18px] text-base leading-[1.7] text-(--tone-muted)">
        v6 is backward compatible with v5: the same <code class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-teal-600"
          >Phalcon\</code
        > namespaces, DI container, ORM, PHQL and Volt, so your application code carries over. What changed is delivery.
        v6 installs with Composer; v5 installs as a C extension through PIE or PECL.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`${DOCS_URL}/learn/how-to/upgrade`}
        class="mt-[22px] inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-lightline-400 pb-1 text-[15px] font-semibold text-teal-700 hover:text-teal-600"
        >Read the migration guide →</a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[14px] sm:grid-cols-2">
      <Card variant="fact" label="Backward compatible" labelColor="#2f8f5b">
        v6 keeps the v5 API surface: namespaces, DI, ORM, PHQL, Volt, routing, ACL, events.
      </Card>
      <Card variant="fact" label="Installing v6" labelColor="#5c7a6e">
        <code class="font-mono text-xs font-medium text-teal-700">composer require phalcon/phalcon</code>. Pure PHP, no
        extension, no compile step.
      </Card>
      <Card variant="fact" label="Still beta" labelColor="#9a6b12">
        v5 remains the stable/LTS default until v6 reaches its stable release.
      </Card>
      <Card variant="fact" label="Installing v5" labelColor="#4b6157">
        C extension via <code class="font-mono text-xs font-medium text-teal-700">pie install</code> or PECL. PECL is
        deprecated but still builds against current PHP releases.
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
